// A sketch opened by a double-click in the feature list is looked at square on, all of it in
// view, and orthographic: two circles on the Top plane (Ø20 at the origin, Ø12 at 120, 40), the
// view isometric and in perspective; a double-click on Sketch 1 turns the view to the Top plane,
// fits both circles beside the sketch dialog and leaves perspective. Then F with part of the
// sketch selected frames that part alone: the small circle picked, F; the large one picked, the
// numpad's point.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("sketch top circle 0 0 10 circle 120 40 6"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("Numpad5"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(30),
        Screenshot("01-isometric-in-perspective"),
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-sketch-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("02-square-on-fitted-orthographic"),
        Click(xyz(126, 40, 0)),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-f-frames-the-selected-circle"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("04-f-with-it-still-selected"),
    ],
)
